PIPELINE SHAPE TRANSITION CONCEPT ANCHOR
==================================================
Raw PIL Image:   (H, W, C)      <- Height, Width, Channels (Standard Image)
ToTensor:        (C, H, W)      <- Channels first (Required by PyTorch)
Batch Tensor:    (B, C, H, W)   <- Batch size appended at dimension 0
==================================================

